body-stage-1-benefits = +10 health. Breath of Renewal: drive your blood around your body to heal.
body-stage-2-benefits = +10 health. Iron Shirt, Mountain Leap and the Earth-Shattering Stomp.
body-stage-3-benefits = +10 health. Shattering Fist, Hundred Fist Barrage, Bone Setting, Accept Body Disciple, and the Thunderclap and Immovable Mountain stances.
body-stage-4-benefits = +10 health. Remold Flesh and the Raging Bull Charge.
body-stage-5-benefits = +15 health. Blood Boil, Falling Mountain Descent and the Mountain-Toppling Throw. Your Mountain Leap now lands like a boulder.
body-stage-6-benefits = +15 health. The Sky-Splitting Palm, and your arts begin to break walls.
body-stage-7-benefits = +15 health. The Vajra Golden Body.
body-stage-8-benefits = +20 health. The Heaven-Shaking Quake, and your arts break even reinforced walls.
body-stage-9-benefits = +20 health. The Primordial Roar. A Primordial Chaos Body can't be shocked.

body-cultivation-examine = [color=#c98a3c]{CAPITALIZE(SUBJECT($target))} {CONJUGATE-HAVE($target)} the unnaturally dense build of a {$stage} body cultivator.[/color]

