## Forge and tribulation

body-power-unlocked = {$power}: {$description}
body-forge-start = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} strains every muscle, forging {POSS-ADJ($user)} {$part}.
body-forge-level = Your {$part} hardens to level {$level}.
body-forge-no-tempering = You have no training banked to forge with. Fight, take hits, punch things, and keep living.
body-forge-peak = You are a Primordial Chaos Body, the peak of the flesh. Every part of you is perfected; there is nothing left to temper.
body-forge-all-capped = Every part of you is forged as far as your stage allows.
body-forge-ready-for-tribulation = Every part of you is forged past your stage. You are ready for the Tribulation of Flesh.
body-tribulation-not-ready = Every part of your body must be forged past your stage first.
body-tribulation-peak = There is no stage beyond the Primordial Chaos Body.
body-tribulation-mortal-cap = A mortal's training stops at Copper Skin. Going further takes the Body Molding Art.
body-tribulation-start = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} sinks to one knee as a sickening chorus of cracks rings out: bones breaking and resetting!
body-tribulation-odds = Readiness {$readiness}: a {$chance}% chance. Be fed, rested, unhurt, in the Mountain stance, on a meditation mat and alone; each later stage is tested harder, and the last step hardest of all.
body-tribulation-success = Steam pours off {THE($user)}'s body, remade: {SUBJECT($user)} {CONJUGATE-HAVE($user)} reached {$stage}!
body-tribulation-fail = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s body fails to hold together and collapses!
body-eternal-heart-refuses = Your body dies... but your heart refuses. Hold on.
body-eternal-heart-recovering = Your eternal heart is still recovering. It can't restart this time.
body-eternal-heart-restarts = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s heart slams back into motion!
body-punch-hurl = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s fist hurls {THE($target)} back like thunder!
body-punch-topple = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s fist knocks {THE($target)} off {POSS-ADJ($target)} feet!

## Manuals

body-manual-qi-cultivator = Your meridians are already full of qi. The path of the flesh is closed to you.
body-manual-known = You already know everything this book can teach you. Forge the Body and the Tribulation of Flesh are on your bar, and in your Techniques menu.
body-manual-primer = Your hard training begins to temper your body. Fight, take hits and Forge the Body to reach Copper Skin.
body-manual-committed = You commit to the Body Molding Art. Your meridians seal into muscle and bone: the way of qi is closed to you, but your body can now be forged to the Primordial Chaos Body. Its first exercises have given you some training to start with: use Forge the Body to pour it into your parts. Fight, take hits and punch things to earn more.

